摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Custom product name and logo branding for DeepSeek Harness Web 自定义 DeepSeek Harness Web 端 logo 和产品名称","id":"gh:1347165448","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-client-ui-brand","slug":"ningbonb/dsh-client-ui-brand","topics":["branding","cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugin-verify","dsh-plugins","logo"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Custom product name and logo branding for DeepSeek Harness Web 自定义 DeepSeek Harness Web 端 logo 和产品名称"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# dsh-client-ui-brand"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"This is a simple DeepSeek Harness plugin. It customizes product branding\nwithout changing DeepSeek H"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"epSeek Harness plugin. It customizes product branding\nwithout changing DeepSeek Harness source code."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What it changes"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- product name in the expanded sidebar and browser title;\n- product mark in the sidebar and empty co"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"nversation;\n- browser favicon and PWA manifest when a logo is configured."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The plugin displays configured marks with centered, proportional fitting in the\nWeb interface. It se"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"parately wraps every favicon and PWA icon in a square,\ntransparent SVG canvas, so non-square marks d"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"o not stretch. HTTPS images are\ndownloaded by the plugin and embedded into browser metadata, so favi"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"con\nrenderers never need a nested external image request. DSH's runtime session\ntitle remains visibl"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"e and ends with the configured product name."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"DSH Core does not currently provide an accepted slot for the empty-conversation\nslogan. This plugin "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"therefore cannot change it without an intrusive\nmodification; it can support the slogan when DSH Cor"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"e exposes that slot."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Install the published package into the Web profile:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Restart the DSH Web process after installation."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Configure"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Add a later Web profile patch, usually at:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The installed bundle already uses **Brand New Agent** and its default Agent\nmark. Every configuratio"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"n field is optional. Add this later profile patch only\nwhen overriding the defaults:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Configuration fields"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Field | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| `productName` | `Brand New Agent` | Sidebar product name, browser title, and PWA name. |\n| `logoUr"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"l` | Not set | HTTPS URL, same-origin absolute path, or `data:image/...` URL for the logo, favicon, "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"and PWA icon. |\n| `logoPath` | Not set | Absolute path to one local image served by DSH for the logo"},{"id":"p21s4","text":", favicon, and PWA icon. |\n| `logoAlt` | `productName` | Accessible logo text. |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Configure either `logoUrl` or `logoPath`, not both."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Local logo"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The local file is exposed only through the fixed route:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"When a logo is configured, the plugin serves the square brand image at\n`/plugins/dsh-client-ui-brand"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"/brand-mark.svg`, generates a PWA manifest at\n`/plugins/dsh-client-ui-brand/manifest.webmanifest`, a"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"nd replaces the Web\nShell's favicon and manifest links. Without a configured logo, the Web Shell\nkee"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"ps its default favicon and manifest."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"For safety, the path must be an absolute, non-symlink regular file with a\n`gif`, `jpeg`, `jpg`, `png"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"`, `svg`, or `webp` extension. The route accepts only\n`GET` and `HEAD`, never accepts a request-cont"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"rolled file path, returns `404`\nwhen the configured file cannot be read, and sends `no-store` and `n"},{"id":"p28s4","text":", returns `404`\nwhen the configured file cannot be read, and sends `no-store` and `nosniff`\nheaders."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
